      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source first.Now I understand the test. It verifies that `withContentNulls()` returns the same instance when the content nulls value is unchanged. Let me write an improved version with better naming and clarity.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version renames the generic `nulls0`/`jsonSetter_Value0`/`jsonSetter_Value1` variables to `failNulls`, `originalValue`, and `valueAfterWithContentNulls`, and adds a Javadoc comment explaining the intent: verifying that `withContentNulls()` returns the same instance when the content-nulls setting is unchanged."
